  {
   "id": 33,
   "en": "Hey, good work.@Thanks for playing this far.@Now, let's do the preview like always.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 34,
   "en": "Rai",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 35,
   "en": "...Same old routine.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 36,
   "en": "Aya",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 37,
   "en": "True. Maybe we should put on a different act?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 38,
   "en": "Mai",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 39,
   "en": "(An act...? So that's what this place was...?!)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 40,
   "en": "Rai's the one who brought it up.@Take responsibility and say something funny.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 41,
   "en": "What... did you say?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 42,
   "en": "A genius like you can pull it off.@Okay, here we go! 3, 2, 1!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 43,
   "en": "Uh... Looking for the R-1?@R you sure? It's right over there.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 44,
   "en": "...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 45,
   "en": "R-Rai...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 46,
   "en": "Viletta",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 47,
   "en": "Fu, fufufu... Ahahahahaha! That's hilarious, Rai!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 48,
   "en": "Huh?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 49,
   "en": "(The Captain's actually kind of...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 50,
   "en": "Kai",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 51,
   "en": "The Special Tactics Instructor Unit I lead has grown@to a decent size. Today I'll introduce our unit's@lone flower among the thorns.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 52,
   "en": "Hugo",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 53,
   "en": "Major, doesn't \"lone flower among the thorns\" mean@one woman among many men? The Instructors@have more women than men now...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 54,
   "en": "Hugo, you're a serious one.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 55,
   "en": "Huh...!?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 56,
   "en": "Radha",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 57,
   "en": "Now, why is Lieutenant Hugo the lone flower...?@You think about it too, okay?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 58,
   "en": "Gilliam",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 59,
   "en": "Hm? I've been called here again?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 60,
   "en": "Say a few words?@I'm running out of material, but it can't be helped.@Well then...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 61,
   "en": "Please support Battle Dodgeball II as well.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 62,
   "en": "...Incidentally, I was the final boss of the@Dodgeball King Tournament, on Roa's team.@Just so you know, it has nothing to do with this story.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 63,
   "en": "Akemi",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 64,
   "en": "Honestly, Akimi...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 65,
   "en": "Shoko",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 66,
   "en": "What's wrong, Akemi?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 67,
   "en": "Just because it's break time,@all he does is play games.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 68,
   "en": "Shoko's big brother is kind of the same.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 69,
   "en": "Really?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 70,
   "en": "And Grandpa does nothing but research,@so he can't do anything around the house...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 71,
   "en": "Cooking, laundry, cleaning, shopping...@Shoko has to do every-thing!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 72,
   "en": "Sh-Shoko, you've really got it rough...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 73,
   "en": "Touya",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 74,
   "en": "Um...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 75,
   "en": "Melua",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 76,
   "en": "What's wrong, Touya?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 77,
   "en": "Well, they told me to say hello here...@and I'm not sure what to do.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 78,
   "en": "Tenia",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 79,
   "en": "Just wing it.@Thanks for playing!@Get some rest, and play again soon!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 80,
   "en": "That's all, the end! Good work! Good night!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 81,
   "en": "You really did just wing it...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 82,
   "en": "Calvina",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 83,
   "en": "Quitting already?@Well, I guess it can't be helped.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 84,
   "en": "Come play again when you feel like it.@And when you do, make sure you sortie me.@Got it?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 85,
